{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Thorns</b> — its root is צנן, like ולצנינים, and its meaning is thorns." "<b>In the crooked path</b> — that he will be caught in them, and the humble man who guards his soul and does no evil is far from the thorns."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:07.235169762Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}